flowchart TD
    subgraph Clientes
        APP1[Aplicações SaaS / Serviços internos]
    end

    APP1 -->|HTTP + API Key| API[Billing Foundation API\n(NestJS + TypeScript)]

    subgraph Core
        API --> AUTH[Core / Auth\nApiKeyMiddleware]
        API --> LOG[Core / Logging\nPino + nestjs-pino]
        API --> HEALTH[Core / Health]
    end

    subgraph Domínios (Modules)
        API --> TEN[Tenants Module]
        API --> USG[Usage Module]
        API --> BIL[Billing Module]
        API --> PLN[Plans Module]
    end

    subgraph Infra
        TEN --> PRISMA[(PrismaService)]
        USG --> PRISMA
        BIL --> PRISMA
        PLN --> PRISMA

        PRISMA --> DB[(Supabase / PostgreSQL)]
    end

    LOG --> LOGS[(Logs estruturados JSON\nrequest_id, tenant_id, api_key_id)]

    subgraph Qualidade
        TESTS[Jest + Supertest\nTestes E2E/integração]
    end

    TESTS --> API